## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Uzbekistan Phone Uniqueness**: Existing user records with duplicate or empty phone numbers will need migration defaults.
> - **SMS Provider Credentials**: For production SMS dispatch, API keys from Eskiz.uz (`api.eskiz.uz`), PlayMobile, or SMS.uz will be configured in `.env` (a mock development driver will be included for local testing).
> - **E-IMZO Agent**: Hardware USB keys and `.pfx` certificates require the official E-IMZO browser client running on port `64443` (standard across all Uzbekistan accounting workstations).

