### 1. Database Schema & Models (`sapar-typescript-backend/prisma/schema.prisma`)

#### [MODIFY] [schema.prisma](file:///c:/Users/Doston/Downloads/SAPAR/SaparCore/sapar-typescript-backend/prisma/schema.prisma)
- Update `User` model:
  - Add `@unique` index on `phone` (standardized E.164: `+998901234567`).
  - Add `stir` (Company STIR / TIN, 9 digits) and `pinfl` (Personal PINFL, 14 digits) fields for E-IMZO certificate matching.
  - Add `eimzoSerial` for bound hardware token serial numbers.
- Add new models:
  - `OtpVerification`: `id`, `phone`, `codeHash`, `expiresAt`, `attempts`, `isUsed`, `createdAt`.
  - `QrAuthSession`: `id`, `sessionToken`, `status` (`PENDING`, `APPROVED`, `EXPIRED`), `userId`, `createdAt`, `expiresAt`.

